<title>UK: LME copper ends AM kerb off lows.</title>
<headline>LME copper ends AM kerb off lows.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Ends AM kerb slightly weaker, but off lows in thin business. Spreads slightly narrower, cash/threes at $65/$70 back vs $75/$80.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Bounces from lows to finish session with small loss.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Mixed after coming off downside with copper, aluminium.</p>
</text>
